        <mxCell id="n32" value="The three orange gates are what makes the architecture hold over time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;boundaries:check turns the context dependency rule from a spoken agreement&lt;br&gt;into a merge blocker. Without it the rule is broken within two weeks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;openapi:check guarantees web and mobile never build against a stale contract.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;diagrams:check means a broken diagram cannot be merged — the report depends&lt;br&gt;on them rendering.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;NOT BUILT YET: the backend has no .github/workflows at all. This is B, week 1." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#c8a415;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="420" width="620" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
